msgid ""
"clangd is a C/C++ language server based on the LLVM/Clang tooling "
"ecosystem. It provides IDE-like features for editors such as:"
msgstr ""
"clangd 是一个基于 LLVM/Clang 工具生态的 C/C++ 语言服务器。它为编辑器提供类似 IDE 的功能，例如："

