msgstr "修复生成头文件的包含问题"

#: ../../source/developing/clangd.md:81
msgid "Installing and setup"
msgstr "安装与设置"

#: ../../source/developing/clangd.md:83
msgid "Open Extensions (Ctrl+Shift+X) and install clangd (publisher - LLVM)."
msgstr "打开扩展（Ctrl+Shift+X）并安装 clangd（发布者 - LLVM）。"

#: ../../source/developing/clangd.md:84
msgid "Proceed with the download prompt."
msgstr "按照下载提示操作。"

#: ../../source/developing/clangd.md:85
msgid ""
"It is recommended to disable the Microsoft C/C++ IntelliSense engine to "
"avoid conflicts. `(Ctrl+Shift+P) -> Preferences: Open Settings (UI) -> "
"Extension -> C/C++ -> IntelliSense`"
msgstr ""
"建议禁用 Microsoft C/C++ IntelliSense 引擎以避免冲突。`(Ctrl+Shift+P) -> Preferences: Open Settings (UI) -> Extension -> C/C++ -> IntelliSense`"

#: ../../source/developing/clangd.md:87
msgid "Then set `IntelliSenseEngine` to `disabled`."
msgstr "然后将 `IntelliSenseEngine` 设置为 `disabled`。"

#: ../../source/developing/clangd.md:89
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

#: ../../source/developing/clangd.md:91
msgid "The extension works as expected until I look at the file for another core"
msgstr "扩展正常工作，直到我查看另一个核的文件时出现问题"

#: ../../source/developing/clangd.md:93
msgid ""
"**Solution**: build your project targeting the files displayed "
"incorrectly.   **Explanation**: clangd provides the information based on "
"the current build's `compile_commands.json`, so if you have built your "
"project targeting the TL321X core, it cannot resolve the files that "
"belong to the TL721X core correctly, since they are not included in the "
"build."
msgstr ""
"**解决方法**：以显示错误的文件为目标重新构建项目。  **说明**：clangd 基于当前构建的 `compile_commands.json` 提供信息，因此如果您之前以 TL321X 核为目标构建了项目，它将无法正确解析属于 TL721X 核的文件，因为这些文件未包含在构建中。"

#: ../../source/developing/clangd.md:96
msgid "I just rebuilt my project, but I still see the warning in the opened file"
msgstr "我刚刚重新构建了项目，但打开的文件中仍然显示警告"

#: ../../source/developing/clangd.md:98
msgid ""
"**Solution**: enforce the update by editing/saving the file.   "
"**Explanation**: file indexing happens lazily, and since it is unknown "
"what needs to be updated after a rebuild, you may need to enforce it."
msgstr ""
"**解决方法**：通过编辑/保存文件来强制更新。  **说明**：文件索引是延迟执行的，由于无法确定重建后需要更新什么，您可能需要强制触发更新。"
